# ^ correctly-spelled name, kept so a future rename is already covered. The file ACTUALLY on
#   disk is spelled `project_requirments.md` — missing the second `e` — which is how it arrived
#   from upstream and is deliberately NOT renamed (the plan and every reference to the spec use
#   that spelling). Without the line below the pattern above matches nothing and the spec gets
#   committed.
project_requirments.md

# NOTE: `schema.graphql` is deliberately absent from this file. It is a COMMITTED build output —
# C3 exports the SDL to it and a test fails when the committed copy drifts from the live schema,
# which only works if the copy is in version control. Do not add it here.
